[271.0,254.5],[262.0,252.0],[251.0,251.5],[241.0,253.5],[231.0,258.5],[223.5,265.5],[219.5,274.5],[219.5,284.5],[223.5,293.5],[232.0,300.5],[245.0,305.5],[262.0,308.5],[284.5,309.5],[307.0,308.5],[320.0,305.5],[331.0,300.5],[336.5,293.5],[340.5,284.5],[349.5,274.5],[347.5,265.5],[340.0,258.5],[328.0,253.5],[318.0,251.5],[307.0,252.0],[298.0,254.5],[291.0,257.0]],"ghi":"Moi hang: [tx,ty,s,r,conf,occ,kL,kR] - 8 cot, PHAI doc ca kL/kR (cot 6-7). Anh xa toa do tham chieu (x,y) (khung 0 cua noi-kin, 540x494, goc tren-trai, y xuong) sang khung i: (1) nen ngang tung nua quanh truc mui x=truc (282): xq = truc+(x-truc)*(x<truc?kL:kR), yq = y (dau quay 3/4 lam nua xa hep lai; kL=kR=1 la khong nen); (2) phep dong dang: x'=s*(cos(r)*xq-sin(r)*yq)+tx, y'=s*(sin(r)*xq+cos(r)*yq)+ty (r radian). Chieu nguoc trong shader: q = nghich dao dong dang(p), roi x = truc+(q.x-truc)/(q.x<truc?kL:kR), y = q.y. Bo kL/kR (coi k=1) lam vien lop phu lech toi 10-25 px (183-239 khung moi clip lech > 3 px) va phu len long cam / mieng dan khi quay 3/4: hang < 8 cot (tep cu) chi duoc coi k=1 kem console.warn. Chi so khung i = khung dang hien: round(mediaTime*60) (requestVideoFrameCallback) hoac floor(currentTime*60+0.001); kep vao [0, so hang f - 1]. occ=1: chan che mom (da dem 3 khung moi phia) -> lam mo overlay theo thoi gian. conf 0..1 chi bao theo doi hong (khop mui + vanh mom sau khi bu nen ngang); KHONG nhan alpha overlay voi conf: overlay luon dac, chi tat/lam mo khi occ=1 hoac conf<0.3 (hong that). poly = ban sao 'polygon' cua mieng.json (bien alpha 0 cua mat na atlas), toa do tham chieu. khung = so khung cua mp4 ma tracking nay danh cho (video co so khung khac -> tracking cu, bao loi). hetTu = khung cuoi con dung tu the dau (<=1 px so voi khung 0 cua ca 3 clip kin; khung 0 cua nghi/noi/cam xuc/cu chi trung khung 0 noi-kin trong 0.1 px). Sau hetTu dau cui xuong (lech toi 11-23 px o khung 359; 7 khung sau hetTu da 5-10 px). Neu khung > hetTu+1 (mp4 chua cat duoi): renderer va demo PHAI coi hetTu la khung cuoi cho MOI chuyen canh (kin->kin, kin->nghi / cam xuc / cu chi): cat thang hetTu -> khung 0 clip sau, hoac tron cheo KET THUC dung tai hetTu (bat dau tai hetTu+1-so khung tron), khong bao gio bat dau tron tu hetTu. Neu khung = hetTu+1 (mp4 da cat duoi) thi het video chinh la hetTu, chuyen canh theo duration nhu clip thuong.","hetTu":347}